# CR 702.16e with ChosenType Creature: the Pyromancer's ping at human is
# refused (its source is a creature), and so is the ping at Serra's Emissary
# itself. Only the source type matters, so the ability still goes on the
# stack and fizzles when the CR 608.2b re-check runs; the Pyromancer is
# tapped for its cost either way.
startturn ai
advance 3
queue targets human
queue action ai activate 2 0
passpriority
